{"status":"PASS","why":"command exit=0","executedAt":"20261126051224","output":"╔══════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║     HuaweiCloud DevKit v2.0.0-next.6          ║\r\n║     https://github.com/huaweicloud   ║\r\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\r\nUsage: npx huaweicloud-devkit \u003ccommand\u003e [--target \u003copencode|codex|codearts|codearts-work|workbuddy|dsh|officeace|hermes|openclaw|atomcode|all\u003e]\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  install      Install skills, MCP server, safety policy\r\n  uninstall    Remove installed files\r\n  update       Update to latest version\r\n  reinstall    Full clean reinstall\r\n  status       Show installation status\r\n  doctor       Self-check: hcloud, MCP, skills, auth\r\n  install-hcloud  Show KooCLI install commands for your OS\r\n  dep          Dependency tooling: status | install \u003cid\u003e | uninstall \u003cid\u003e\r\n  packs        Post-install pack surface: status | enable \u003cids\u003e | disable \u003cids\u003e | all\r\n  auth         Manage unified auth: init | sync | status | reconcile\r\n  secret       Encrypted secret vault: set | get | list | rm | exec\r\n  proxy        Manage proxy config: init | show | clear\r\n  version      Print CLI version and installed plugin version per agent\r\n  help         Show this help\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  --target     Target agent: opencode (default), codex, codearts, codearts-work, workbuddy, dsh, officeace, hermes, openclaw, atomcode, all\r\n  --packs      Install-time pack selection: \u003cid,id,...\u003e or \"all\" (full surface). Writes DEVKIT_PACKS into the agent MCP config env; existing user values are kept\r\n  --skip-binaries   (with: install/update) skip provisioning host binaries for enabled packs\r\n  --version    Print CLI version and installed plugin version per agent\r\n  --clean-kocli    (with: uninstall --target all) also remove KooCLI\r\n  --clean-obs      (with: uninstall --target all) also remove OBS config\r\n  --clean-gateway  (with: uninstall --target all) also remove the devkit-installed open-mcp-gateway\r\n  --clean-global   (with: uninstall --target all) also remove KooCLI + OBS config + open-mcp-gateway\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target codex\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target codearts\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target codearts-work\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target workbuddy\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target dsh\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target officeace\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target hermes\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target atomcode\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target all\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit install --target opencode --packs sandbox\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit packs status\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit packs enable sandbox,obs\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit dep status\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit dep install hcloud\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit dep uninstall hcloud\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit auth init\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit auth sync --target all\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit auth status --target all\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit proxy init\r\n  npx huaweicloud-devkit proxy show"}